        "slc_d9b94daf3c5d4c7b3cde0e9703c3d30c65be38729d046069f8411a98d9984269"
      ],
      "text": "lazyide is a lightweight terminal IDE written in Rust with ratatui, shipped as a single binary with file tree, tabbed editing, LSP, syntax highlighting, folding, git integration, project search, 32 themes, and customizable keybindings."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c1dd30162aac2892624a2be780d1a6c703c94ff38c3ddbf1730af1a7a94ba2a5",
