        "slc_88414a47382fa74aa91d58303684c1e7f85a1d71615c854899fea0af8252b499"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes a `--setup` CLI flag that detects and installs optional tools (rust-analyzer, ripgrep), and is run as `lazyide` (or `cargo run -- /path/to/project`) inside a terminal."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_db15d92c7985ee8ad9593d82e6b532eda70e1a24110b9012d272b23353c825f4",
