        "slc_8adeba1468638b6ed519c46842ec4ad0f6090555d1ac54c96bf7ada01c91a364"
      ],
      "text": "LSP support is implemented by spawning a rust-analyzer child process over JSON-RPC, with a background stdout reader thread and per-frame polling that matches responses to pending completion/definition requests."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2d39f520e0eba27be3e961603fd9120c421afe83b3a104584ccd1b59f4d64203",
