        "slc_d92bee1716dd534da3e51ea63e0cb0b737998e79f2d4fcfdb4665c25ded9ddd3"
      ],
      "text": "Git integration shells out to the `git` binary rather than using libgit2, using commands like `git rev-parse`, `git status --porcelain -z`, and `git diff HEAD` for branch, status, and line-level diff data."
    },
